OL,3,ACostume exhibition celebrates 50 years
OL,4,Aof city's 'spaceship-like' theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty years ago, the Royal Exchange
OL,7,FTheatre in Manchester opened its doors
OL,8,Ffor its first production of Richard
OL,9,FBrinsley Sheridan's The Rivals.
OL,11,FIt was September 1976, and the
OL,12,Fseven-sided theatre constructed from
OL,13,Ftubular steel in the heart of the city
OL,14,Fwas described by some as something from
OL,15,Fout of space.
OL,17,F"It sits almost like a spaceship inside
OL,18,Fthis extraordinary great Victorian Hall
OL,19,Fwith all the pillars so already you
OL,20,Fhave this tension," said Selina
OL,21,FCartmell, the theatre's creative
OL,22,Fdirector.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
