OL,3,ACostume exhibition celebrates 50 years
OL,4,Aof city's 'spaceship-like' theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"They created a theatre of 750 seats in
OL,7,Fthe round, a democratic arena where the
OL,8,Falchemy between actor and audience is
OL,9,Fat its most purest form and they've
OL,10,Fcreated something that still feels
OL,11,Ffresh today."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
